WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.631 --> 00:00:20.013
Ben groaned as he bumped into the wall, right behind Winnie.

2
00:00:20.033 --> 00:00:24.096
"I think there's a boiler room on the other side of this wall."

3
00:00:24.116 --> 00:00:27.859
"Maybe we can cut through the gym," Gaby said.

4
00:00:27.879 --> 00:00:28.800
"Come on!"

5
00:00:33.132 --> 00:00:36.955
The five friends dodged through the gym equipment and reached the far door.

6
00:00:39.257 --> 00:00:42.260
In the hallway, they started following the compass again.

7
00:00:43.601 --> 00:00:45.502
At last they came to a glass door.

8
00:00:45.522 --> 00:00:48.405
"The greenhouse!"

9
00:00:48.705 --> 00:00:49.405
Gaby said.

10
00:00:49.426 --> 00:00:53.149
"I hope the treasure is buried here," Waldo said.

11
00:00:53.169 --> 00:00:56.832
"The floor of the greenhouse is dirt—it should be easy to dig."

12
00:00:59.434 --> 00:01:03.221
They went inside and Winnie ran along, following the compass.

13
00:01:07.524 --> 00:01:08.644
buried right here!"

14
00:01:08.924 --> 00:01:11.466
she cried, tracing a big X on the ground.

15
00:01:11.486 --> 00:01:15.689
"X marks the spot!"

16
00:01:16.109 --> 00:01:18.030
Mog grinned and started digging.

17
00:01:20.892 --> 00:01:26.216
They found some more shovels in the greenhouse, and soon everyone was digging—and sweating.

18
00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:32.705
They dug for hours.

19
00:01:37.027 --> 00:01:38.848
Finally Gaby stopped to rest.

20
00:01:38.868 --> 00:01:42.690
"It's hot in here," she said.

21
00:01:42.710 --> 00:01:45.392
"And we're making such slow progress.

22
00:01:45.852 --> 00:01:47.273
We don't have much time left."

23
00:01:47.293 --> 00:01:51.995
"I need a snack," Mog complained.

24
00:01:52.015 --> 00:01:53.976
"And some sleep."

25
00:01:55.157 --> 00:01:57.258
"Hey!" Waldo snapped his fingers.

26
00:01:57.278 --> 00:02:00.340
"I'll use magic to make the shovels dig on their own!"

27
00:02:00.916 --> 00:02:02.397
He started to cast a spell.

28
00:02:02.417 --> 00:02:08.742
"Shovels strong and shovels true—" "Waldo—" Winnie warned.

29
00:02:08.762 --> 00:02:16.128
"Do the digging for me and—ah-ah-ah "Uh-oh," Mog murmured.

30
00:02:16.148 --> 00:02:21.513
"Choo!" Waldo sneezed, and all the shovels turned into worms.

31
00:02:23.955 --> 00:02:28.098
The worms wriggled away before Winnie could try to turn them back into shovels.

32
00:02:30.564 --> 00:02:31.465
"Ack!" Mog cried.

33
00:02:31.485 --> 00:02:33.846
"Now what are we going to do?"

34
00:02:34.706 --> 00:02:38.108
The kids slumped to the ground, dirty and exhausted.

35
00:02:41.310 --> 00:02:44.211
Nobody said anything until Ben got to his feet.

36
00:02:46.833 --> 00:02:48.454
"I'll look around," he said.

37
00:02:48.474 --> 00:02:51.395
"Maybe there are some other tools we can use for digging."

38
00:02:52.776 --> 00:02:55.818
Rumble! Just then Ben heard something outside.

39
00:02:55.838 --> 00:02:57.038
"Oh no!"

40
00:02:57.479 --> 00:02:58.039
he cried.

41
00:02:58.059 --> 00:02:59.520
"The wrecking crew!"

42
00:03:00.664 --> 00:03:05.706
Soon bulldozers, wrecking balls, and steam shovels would be destroying their school!

43
00:03:05.726 --> 00:03:07.846
"Steam shovels!"

44
00:03:08.086 --> 00:03:08.906
Ben blurted out.

45
00:03:08.926 --> 00:03:13.988
"Winnie, can you make a magical steam shovel to dig faster?"

46
00:03:14.008 --> 00:03:17.069
"I don't know anything about steam shovels!"

47
00:03:17.409 --> 00:03:18.089
Winnie cried.

48
00:03:18.109 --> 00:03:21.770
"I'm still learning magic, and I don't have a spell book."

49
00:03:22.570 --> 00:03:23.971
Waldo jumped to his feet.

50
00:03:23.991 --> 00:03:26.531
"I can try—" "No!"

51
00:03:27.172 --> 00:03:28.032
everyone shouted.

52
00:03:29.228 --> 00:03:30.809
"I wasn't going to try magic."

53
00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:32.351
Waldo looked offended.

54
00:03:32.371 --> 00:03:35.333
"I just wanted to explain how steam shovels work."

55
00:03:36.274 --> 00:03:36.795
"Tell me!"

56
00:03:36.815 --> 00:03:37.895
Winnie cried.

57
00:03:39.617 --> 00:03:44.081
Waldo quickly described how steam shovels work, sketching diagrams in the dirt.

58
00:03:50.867 --> 00:03:52.528
Then Winnie closed her eyes.

59
00:03:52.548 --> 00:04:00.461
"Shovel, shovel, soil and rubble Help us dig out of this trouble!"

60
00:04:02.481 --> 00:04:05.682
Zap! A steam shovel appeared and went instantly to work.

61
00:04:07.603 --> 00:04:09.603
Dirt flew all over the greenhouse.

62
00:04:12.064 --> 00:04:15.005
Clunk! At last the steam shovel hit something.

63
00:04:15.025 --> 00:04:17.125
"The treasure chest!"

64
00:04:17.546 --> 00:04:18.246
Mog cried.

65
00:04:18.686 --> 00:04:20.106
Ben glanced out the window.

66
00:04:20.606 --> 00:04:23.207
Bulldozers had nearly reached the school's driveway.

67
00:04:23.227 --> 00:04:26.148
"Quick! Let's lift it out of the ground!"

68
00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:29.581
The steam shovel lifted the chest out of the ground.

69
00:04:29.601 --> 00:04:32.522
"Open the doors," Winnie said.

70
00:04:32.542 --> 00:04:34.482
"Let's get the chest outside!"

71
00:04:36.083 --> 00:04:41.164
Waldo threw open the greenhouse doors, and they hauled the heavy chest out onto the lawn.

72
00:04:42.344 --> 00:04:43.625
Mayor Hubbletree and Mr.

73
00:04:43.725 --> 00:04:46.085
Freaky were standing near the school's main entrance.

74
00:04:46.906 --> 00:04:48.566
And Ben spotted someone else.

75
00:04:49.026 --> 00:04:55.588
Pedro! He was racing toward the bulldozer with two other pirates.

76
00:04:56.204 --> 00:04:58.525
The old skeletons waved their swords.

77
00:04:59.545 --> 00:05:01.045
"Stop!" Pedro yelled.

78
00:05:01.065 --> 00:05:05.247
"You'll have to go through us to knock down Monster Academy!"

79
00:05:05.687 --> 00:05:08.447
The three pirates leaped in front of the bulldozers.

80
00:05:08.467 --> 00:05:13.389
"Pedro, get out of the way," Mayor Hubbletree commanded.

81
00:05:14.149 --> 00:05:16.130
Pedro stood fiercely with his crew.

82
00:05:16.150 --> 00:05:20.851
"Wait!" Mog waved his arms madly.

83
00:05:20.871 --> 00:05:22.431
"Pedro! Mr.

84
00:05:22.471 --> 00:05:24.352
Freaky! We found the treasure!"

85
00:05:25.408 --> 00:05:27.089
"You don't have to knock down the school!"

86
00:05:27.409 --> 00:05:28.050
Ben yelled.

87
00:05:29.231 --> 00:05:31.172
Pedro looked over and saw the chest.

88
00:05:31.192 --> 00:05:34.614
"Whew!" he said.

89
00:05:34.634 --> 00:05:39.277
"To tell you the truth, I wasn't sure we could stop these bulldozers."

90
00:05:42.179 --> 00:05:43.420
The mayor rushed over.

91
00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:46.382
"Open that chest!"

92
00:05:47.983 --> 00:05:50.465
Pedro broke the rusty old lock with his sword.

93
00:05:51.225 --> 00:05:52.606
He threw open the lid.

94
00:05:53.727 --> 00:05:55.168
The mayor bent forward.

95
00:05:55.968 --> 00:05:56.749
"What's this?"

96
00:05:57.329 --> 00:05:57.950
he bellowed.

97
00:05:58.630 --> 00:05:59.851
Ben floated closer.

98
00:06:00.431 --> 00:06:03.894
Inside the chest lay not gold but "Huh?

99
00:06:04.774 --> 00:06:06.255
Musical instruments?"

100
00:06:07.396 --> 00:06:08.397
Pedro grinned.

101
00:06:08.417 --> 00:06:12.180
"We were the best pirate band on the seas!"

102
00:06:13.361 --> 00:06:16.163
He reached for a xylophone with his bony fingers.

103
00:06:17.524 --> 00:06:19.905
Mr. Freaky collapsed onto the ground.

104
00:06:19.925 --> 00:06:23.428
"Monster Academy is doomed!

105
00:06:24.392 --> 00:06:26.513
Music won't save the school."

106
00:06:26.533 --> 00:06:28.374
"Of course it will!"

107
00:06:28.755 --> 00:06:29.495
Pedro said.

108
00:06:29.515 --> 00:06:34.978
"I could find only our drummer and banjo player, but we can still put on a concert."

109
00:06:34.998 --> 00:06:39.201
"Pedro and the Pirates will fill Monster Stadium!"

110
00:06:39.541 --> 00:06:40.221
Waldo said.

111
00:06:40.241 --> 00:06:43.943
"They'll definitely raise enough money to repair our school."

112
00:06:47.265 --> 00:06:49.527
Mr. Freaky slowly climbed to his feet.

113
00:06:49.547 --> 00:06:51.848
"I told you students not to worry.

114
00:06:52.516 --> 00:06:56.379
Everything at Monster Academy is totally under control!"

115
00:06:58.060 --> 00:07:00.681
Ben turned to Mog, who was holding a banjo.

116
00:07:00.701 --> 00:07:03.663
"Still want to be a pirate when you grow up?"

117
00:07:03.683 --> 00:07:07.926
"Nah." Mog shook his head and strummed the banjo.

118
00:07:07.946 --> 00:07:11.308
"Maybe I'll join a band instead!"
